  "instructions": [
    "heat 1/4 cup of orange juice and 1 tbsp of honey in a non-stick skillet over medium heat",
    "add 1 tsp of cumin and 1/2 tsp of paprika, stir to combine",
    "add 4 tilapia fillets and cook for 3-4 minutes per side, or until cooked through",
    "transfer the tilapia to a plate and cover with foil to keep warm",
    "add 1/4 cup of yucatecan red pickled onions, chopped fresh cilantro, and 2 chopped cortland apples to the skillet",
    "stir to combine",
    "warm 4 tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds",
    "assembled the tacos by placing a piece of tilapia on each tortilla, topping with a spoonful of the onion-apple-cilantro mixture, and serving with a dollop of sour cream",
    "serve immediately"
  ],
